{"3524720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HAEX", "steam_appid": 3524720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/a98d12dfd3fc8d11b9c7b72e8d2c80d6.avif?t=1787250680\" width=780 height=137 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A co-op survival shooter for 1-4 players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this procedural open-world action-adventure, your character and worlds are saved separately. Unlock new gear, acquire skills and find crafting recipes that you can take anywhere. Start a new world for a fresh adventure, or jump into a friend's game fully geared up. Every world keeps its own story. Every character keeps its own progression.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/8fa75980026b22135d56db21c376db14.poster.avif?t=1787250680\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/8fa75980026b22135d56db21c376db14.webm?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/8fa75980026b22135d56db21c376db14.mp4?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An extraterrestrial power journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a sentient cube that allows you to effortlessly gather resources and scan your surroundings. Upgrade it to level up its capabilities. Unlock powerful alien abilities as you progress, opening up new ways to traverse the world with moves like dashing and double-jumping.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/c9ace57a4e765ac7fb619e611596da4d.poster.avif?t=1787250680\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/c9ace57a4e765ac7fb619e611596da4d.webm?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/c9ace57a4e765ac7fb619e611596da4d.mp4?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plant alien seeds to reshape a sub-arctic open world </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find or craft alien seeds that let you transform your world, and open new possibilities. Planting them unlocks unique new areas and resources, but beware of the new threats you might unleash on your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/2ea67dc1ea9b079365bec7f5b976939c.poster.avif?t=1787250680\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/2ea67dc1ea9b079365bec7f5b976939c.webm?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/2ea67dc1ea9b079365bec7f5b976939c.mp4?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find the science expedition that went silent in the mist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth what happened. The further you go the more dangerous the world becomes. Meet a cast of characters across the world, each with their own insights about the events unfolding around you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/912d99fd85fc57c712e2a06ec55df5ff.poster.avif?t=1787250680\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/912d99fd85fc57c712e2a06ec55df5ff.webm?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/912d99fd85fc57c712e2a06ec55df5ff.mp4?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the cold and build your survival skills </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold kills. Hunger slows you down. Go too deep without the right gear and you won't come back. Enemies, resources, and secrets all evolve with depth, and so do the rewards. Discover and explore alien structures in your search for more skills to unlock and weapons to craft.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/9d1ab44062afcfd6410e677d0d0439bc.poster.avif?t=1787250680\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/9d1ab44062afcfd6410e677d0d0439bc.webm?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/9d1ab44062afcfd6410e677d0d0439bc.mp4?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tune your loadout for what’s stalking the next clearing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between visceral gunplay and heavy melee, use gadgets, and improve your loadout to combat threats the mist unleashes. A deep and modular weapon mod system will let you play the way you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/6c4445110d30620e2708a58914b35ba5.poster.avif?t=1787250680\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/6c4445110d30620e2708a58914b35ba5.webm?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/6c4445110d30620e2708a58914b35ba5.mp4?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/a98d12dfd3fc8d11b9c7b72e8d2c80d6.avif?t=1787250680\" width=780 height=137 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A co-op survival shooter for 1-4 players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this procedural open-world action-adventure, your character and worlds are saved separately. Unlock new gear, acquire skills and find crafting recipes that you can take anywhere. Start a new world for a fresh adventure, or jump into a friend's game fully geared up. Every world keeps its own story. Every character keeps its own progression.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/8fa75980026b22135d56db21c376db14.poster.avif?t=1787250680\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/8fa75980026b22135d56db21c376db14.webm?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/8fa75980026b22135d56db21c376db14.mp4?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An extraterrestrial power journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a sentient cube that allows you to effortlessly gather resources and scan your surroundings. Upgrade it to level up its capabilities. Unlock powerful alien abilities as you progress, opening up new ways to traverse the world with moves like dashing and double-jumping.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/c9ace57a4e765ac7fb619e611596da4d.poster.avif?t=1787250680\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/c9ace57a4e765ac7fb619e611596da4d.webm?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/c9ace57a4e765ac7fb619e611596da4d.mp4?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plant alien seeds to reshape a sub-arctic open world </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find or craft alien seeds that let you transform your world, and open new possibilities. Planting them unlocks unique new areas and resources, but beware of the new threats you might unleash on your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/2ea67dc1ea9b079365bec7f5b976939c.poster.avif?t=1787250680\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/2ea67dc1ea9b079365bec7f5b976939c.webm?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/2ea67dc1ea9b079365bec7f5b976939c.mp4?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find the science expedition that went silent in the mist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth what happened. The further you go the more dangerous the world becomes. Meet a cast of characters across the world, each with their own insights about the events unfolding around you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/912d99fd85fc57c712e2a06ec55df5ff.poster.avif?t=1787250680\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/912d99fd85fc57c712e2a06ec55df5ff.webm?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/912d99fd85fc57c712e2a06ec55df5ff.mp4?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the cold and build your survival skills </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold kills. Hunger slows you down. Go too deep without the right gear and you won't come back. Enemies, resources, and secrets all evolve with depth, and so do the rewards. Discover and explore alien structures in your search for more skills to unlock and weapons to craft.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/9d1ab44062afcfd6410e677d0d0439bc.poster.avif?t=1787250680\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/9d1ab44062afcfd6410e677d0d0439bc.webm?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/9d1ab44062afcfd6410e677d0d0439bc.mp4?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tune your loadout for what’s stalking the next clearing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between visceral gunplay and heavy melee, use gadgets, and improve your loadout to combat threats the mist unleashes. A deep and modular weapon mod system will let you play the way you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/6c4445110d30620e2708a58914b35ba5.poster.avif?t=1787250680\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/6c4445110d30620e2708a58914b35ba5.webm?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/extras/6c4445110d30620e2708a58914b35ba5.mp4?t=1787250680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "An anomaly has been detected in the sub-arctic north. The science team sent to investigate has gone missing. Survive an alien-scarred wilderness solo or with up to 3 friends. Push back the mist, reshape the world, craft weapons and gear, and fight to unearth what happened.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/f2b2f31e99d12986502485d9cebff05a10c5c2ac/header.jpg?t=1787250680", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/7d98285ce9492f468b95b92dd3002011d0f2bee5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787250680", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524720/7d98285ce9492f468b95b92dd3002011d0f2bee5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787250